00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.320
Welcome to this No Black Box Machine Learning course in JavaScript.

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:10.920
You will gain a deep understanding of machine learning systems by coding without relying

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:12.600
on libraries.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:17.400
This unique approach not only demystifies the inner workings of machine learning, but

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.960
also significantly enhances software development skills.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:26.760
The course is designed and taught by Radu, who has a PhD in Computer Science and as a

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:32.080
university lecturer, from building a drawing app and working with data to exploring feature

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:38.480
extraction and implementing various classifiers, this course covers a wide array of topics

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:43.360
that will equip you with the knowledge and expertise to create your own machine learning

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:45.400
driven applications.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:49.720
Hi and welcome to the No Black Box Machine Learning course in JavaScript.

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:53.640
It's a course where we code without using libraries because it's the best way to learn

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:58.480
all inner workings in a machine learning system, and you'll greatly improve your software development

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:00.040
skills as well.

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:04.400
Actually, the course is a lot about software engineering, especially in the beginning,

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:08.760
and the focus slowly shifts towards machine learning as it goes on.

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:12.640
